  "exact_baking": "tools/SceneBakeTool.cs + scenes/tools/SceneBakeTool.tscn produce the authoritative scene content using the original WorldBuilder in the target source checkout",
  "limitations": [
    "Town_Preview is a static starter; attach no gameplay scripts and do not add it to Main while the old world is also rendered",
    "Only the bake tool regenerates exact legacy procedural foliage, mesh content and full landmark visuals",
    "Some finale interaction anchors/props are runtime-owned by Main or world build systems and must be migrated through an adapter, not replaced by decorative preview nodes",
    "RallyRoad.obj is editor-preview-only with NO collision; use baked RallyRoad or retain original RallyRoadBuilder at runtime",
    "Procedural buildings carry text and decorative approximations; exact bake restores native Geo.Triangle gables, correct collision and font/label style"
  ],
  "visual_glitches_from_screenshots": [
    "Extremely close third-person camera inside player house can obscure the avatar and clip against interior geometry",
    "Large trees in the foreground obscure the player and large parts of the screen in several views",
    "Road junctions and rally/through-road crossings show visible rectangular overlays and hard seams",
    "Bridge approach, road and gate areas need collision/visual alignment checks",
    "Close-range signs and roof edges cover a substantial part of the gameplay view",
    "Some sign text and labels are visually occluded or difficult to read behind other geometry"
  ],
